Part A finding: PUT on the `enabled` leaf disables and enables the port through both models, and every layer agrees (RESTCONF state,
CLI, running-config, DUT log, link partner). PATCH -- RESTCONF's merge method -- does not: on the leaf it answers 204 and changes
nothing (the only trace is that the explicit `enabled true` leaf disappears from the OC config read), and on the list entry it
answers 404. Same as 2026-10-13 on -20261008-57.

